@dsh-external/dsh-drop-to-path README · Why this plugin：I use a text-only model (deepseek) in DeepSeek Harness and frequently need to send screenshots to the agent. But DSH image attachments go through the model's native attachment channel, and text-only models are rejected by a preflight check before the message is even sent — the composer shows a system toast:

> **The current model does not support images; switch to a model that does.**

